WEBVTT

00:12:29.828 --> 00:12:31.079
And it was mine.

00:12:33.832 --> 00:12:35.667
These days,

00:12:35.709 --> 00:12:37.669
I've come a long way with this guy.

00:12:38.253 --> 00:12:45.260
(Applause)

00:12:51.433 --> 00:12:56.396
This thing that once represented
everything I feared,

00:12:56.438 --> 00:12:58.816
everything I had lost,

00:12:58.857 --> 00:13:01.318
it's probably the thing
I'm most proud of in my life